Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=8}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:56.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! He just...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.85,0:01:59.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He just broke\NCaptain Kuro's "cat claw".
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.35,0:02:05.15,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,That leaves only five\Nmore of those weird swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:11.07,Main-207-,Pirate A,0,0,0,,Don't worry, guys!\NHe can still fight plenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.07,0:02:13.07,Main-207-,Pirate G,0,0,0,,Yeah!\NHe still has that other claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:16.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can do it! Rip that guy\Nto shreds, Captain Kuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.66,0:02:18.45,Main-207-,Pirate Z,0,0,0,,Don't use\Nthat name anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:19.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He doesn't like it, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.83,0:02:23.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think in this village his name\Nis Klaha... something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:25.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Klaha-something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:28.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,something! Get him good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:33.38,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,Shut your mouths! All of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.35,0:02:44.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come out you brats!\NI know you're hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:45.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give yourselves up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.69,0:02:52.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come over here, and we'll take\Nyou to her! Just don't kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.03,0:02:58.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm stupid?\NI won't fall for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:02:59.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You silly rug rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.87,0:03:04.04,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Oh, dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We got him...! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:12.30,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Pepper Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.53,0:03:41.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:47.04,Main-207-,Boys,0,0,0,,End of the line, hypnotist!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:47.75,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:57.34,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Looks like you bit off\Na little more than you could chew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:03:59.93,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,No! We failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.93,0:04:04.97,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Real pirates don't take kindly\Nto being mocked by the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:08.27,Main-207-,Both,0,0,0,,Onion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.27,0:04:13.48,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,You pretend pirates sure\Ngot in over your heads, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.48,0:04:14.40,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:16.32,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:19.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rich girl, I know you're here!\NListen! Unless you show yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.49,0:04:23.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll execute these three little lambs...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:26.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I will make sure to do it\Nin a most painful fashion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:29.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do not doubt\Nmy skill at such a task!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.47,0:04:39.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.93,0:04:41.89,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya!\NRun for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:46.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Hey!\N– Yeah. That's them all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:47.77,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,They're\Nthe other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:53.19,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,Soon enough I'll deal with you\Nin the only appropriate manner...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:57.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Extermination! I'll also kill\Nthat fool Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:05:00.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, why kill us, Captain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.61,0:05:03.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, please don't\Njoke around like that, Captain Kuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:06.70,Main-207-,Pirate O,0,0,0,,It's still not too late\Nfor us to attack the village, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:07.50,Main-207-,Pirate Z,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:09.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if Captain Jango gets\Nher to write her will,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:11.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then your plan\Nshould still work perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.67,0:05:17.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This plan is no longer\Nany of your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:21.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}When all of you are dead, this village\Nwill know who to blame for this atrocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:26.10,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,I never intended\Nto let any of you mongrels
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:28.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,leave this village alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.39,0:05:34.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}No one... No one who knows my true identity\Ncan be allowed to live to tell about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:35.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.57,0:05:40.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You had already planned to kill every\Nlast one of us from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.07,0:05:44.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:47.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three years ago I planned\Nto erase Captain Kuro,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.83,0:05:52.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and every last person\Nwho ever knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's all part\Nof my plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.59,0:05:58.80,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,You guys are dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:01.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're the most uncool pirates I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:03.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh. We're "uncool", huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.89,0:06:06.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are nothing more\Nthan savages,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:09.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,incapable of rising\Nabove their animal nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.43,0:06:12.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Without my plans, what could\Nthey possibly accomplish?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:17.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A crew is nothing to me. They\Nare simply a means to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:21.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crewmembers are just pawns\Nin the Captain's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:24.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whether my men live or die\Nis up to me and me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:27.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I tell them to fight,\Nthey will fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.03,0:06:29.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and if I order them to die,\Nthey had better do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:32.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They know the punishment\Nfor disobedience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.71,0:06:36.88,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,This is\Nhow pirates are!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:40.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare\Ntalk down to me, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.93,0:06:48.14,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,You know, no matter\Nhow many hundreds,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:51.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or thousands of men follow\Nyou as their Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:55.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You will never be\Nas good as Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.23,0:07:03.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You fool. Are you saying that I am\Ninferior to a kid {\i1}pretending{\i0} to be a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:04.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.70,0:07:09.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you\Nfunny?! Don't get all cocky
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:13.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,just because you snapped off\None of my cat claws!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:17.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How exactly is he better\Nthan me?! Let's hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:24.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause he's got heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:25.84,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,He's got what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:30.60,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,A guy like you doesn't know\Nwhat a true pirate is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:38.85,Main-207-,Pirate A,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:47.45,Main-207-,Pirate I,0,0,0,,He kept up\Nwith the pussyfoot maneuver!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.91,0:07:52.79,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,How insulting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:59.75,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,It would appear that you need\Na lesson in what real pirates are like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:03.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:05.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your first lesson will be\Nabout terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:10.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A lesson I learned well\Nas I stared down death!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:17.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Should he be\Nin that stance?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.23,0:08:19.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, this is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.23,0:08:21.65,Main-207-,Pirate X,0,0,0,,Why's he using\Nthat technique?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.65,0:08:23.48,Main-207-,Pirate Dd,0,0,0,,He's\Nonly fighting one guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:27.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to use\Nthe Out of the Back Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:30.24,Main-207-,Pirate X,0,0,0,,This isn't\Na good spot for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:31.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, he could get us too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.03,0:08:34.87,Main-207-,Pirate M,0,0,0,,Yeah. He did say\Nhe was gonna kill us all earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:36.95,Main-207-,Pirate Dd,0,0,0,,Please, Captain Kuro!\NAnything but that technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:40.25,Main-207-,Pirate G,0,0,0,,We'll do\Nanything, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:43.00,Main-207-,Pirate X,0,0,0,,Please,\NCaptain Kuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:47.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal? He's\Njust wobbling back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.97,0:08:52.30,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Out\Nof the Back Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:03.52,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,What a small haul!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:08.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know I really thought\Nthey'd have more treasure than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:11.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's see if the boys\Nhave finished this fight yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:17.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? What...? Everyone\Nhas stopped... Is it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:31.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's he doing over there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:38.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That guy's everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:46.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't do this, Captain!\NPlease stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.07,0:09:47.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.19,0:09:49.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't reason with him\Nnow that he's started!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:53.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His sidestep maneuver is so fast\Nnot even he knows what he's cutting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.91,0:09:56.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But how could he have killed\Nso many of us without even...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:09:58.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.54,0:10:06.04,Thoughts-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,What's\Nhappening out there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:08.55,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,People are just\Ngetting cut to ribbons!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:24.44,Thoughts-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,Show yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:27.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Butler!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:43.79,Main-207-,,0,0,5,,Don't you have any honor?!\NThose men are your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.25,0:10:47.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:14.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:16.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.91,0:11:20.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should've accepted\Nyour fate like a good boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:22.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now look what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:26.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, my little pawns\Nare still alive, and in misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:31.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It would have been better\Nto just let them die in the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:36.68,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,So, now what? Do\Nyou have something to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.68,0:11:38.43,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:40.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter what\Nhappens to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.10,0:11:44.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will {\i1}never{\i0} be like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:46.35,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,Not "will".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:49.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:51.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,can't be like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:55.82,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:58.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are going\Nto die here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.07,0:12:02.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.33,0:12:06.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, leave the children\Nbe. I'll write the will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:12.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill you as soon\Nas you write that will!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:12.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No, Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:15.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Silly girl. Don't you know\Nyou can't bargain with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:19.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro specifically instructed\Nme to get rid of {\i1}everyone{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.55,0:12:20.80,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:28.27,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Wha...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.27,0:12:31.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you don't do exactly as I say\Nthen you won't get to kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.65,0:12:33.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and, I won't write my will!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.98,0:12:35.94,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:37.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just calm down!\NDon't be so hasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:40.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I absolutely have to get\Nyou to write that will!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:43.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop! Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:48.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright! Fine, I'll let\Nthe little brats go...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:51.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, in their condition, they won't\Nbe making too quick of a getaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:57.26,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Don't forget\Nto sign your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:12:58.80,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:05.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"I leave\Nmy entire fortune to my butler,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:07.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Klahadore," Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.85,0:13:12.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very good! This is your will,\Nall right! Excellent work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.73,0:13:14.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now remember,\Nwe had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.61,0:13:16.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You promised me\Nyou wouldn't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:23.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just relax. I know I may not look like\Nit, but I'm regarded as an honest man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:33.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:38.01,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,– Okay! I'll be back!\N– What the...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.01,0:13:40.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's enough of that,\Nhypno-freak! Let the girl go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.51,0:13:43.59,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Dammit!\NLooks like I was followed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:54.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess I'd better finish off\Nthe rich girl quickly then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:14:01.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was simply a warm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:02.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:05.91,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,The real fight\Nbegins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:08.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Soon I will be feasting\Non your fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.33,0:14:11.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Complimented by the sweet\Nwine of your agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.71,0:14:12.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:16.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.09,0:14:18.09,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,Out\Nof the Back Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:38.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice try. You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:41.24,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,Damn you!\NGet away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:44.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow, butler-man! Right now\Nyour life really sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:46.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your plan of three years is\Na complete and total failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.53,0:14:47.41,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.41,0:14:50.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! That weird kid\Ncaught Captain Kuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:53.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!\NIf that goofy kid manages to beat him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:56.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then that means Captain Kuro\Nwon't be able to slaughter us, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.13,0:15:00.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:02.51,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,– Oh no, you don't!\N– Uh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.55,0:15:05.76,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:10.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid, snot-nosed brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:11.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:15.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're one\Nstep too late, Swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.85,0:15:17.40,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Wouldn't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.94,0:15:21.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:25.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That branch was getting\Nin the way of my shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:26.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help me, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.24,0:15:29.37,Main-207-,All,0,0,0,,Do it, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.44,0:15:32.30,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,Eat this, hypnotist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:34.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Get 'em\Nyou crazy, rubber guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.71,0:15:36.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're goin' down,\Nyou mean bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:38.38,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.29,0:15:41.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.17,0:15:44.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have no right\Nto cheer me on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.21,0:15:46.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.47,0:15:48.43,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:51.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now! Time for the exploding star!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.27,0:15:57.94,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,– You insect!\N– Bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:16:00.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– My plan will absolutely\N– Bell!
